# Lightweight ChimeraX script for 6QX9
# Models are downloaded directly by ChimeraX from the PDB.
# Primary maps, when requested, are downloaded directly from EMDB.
# Deposited chains are renamed in-session to systematic project IDs.

# Shared anchor frame: 8H6L
# Structure group: #347; target model: #347.1; RNA labels: #347.2.

open 8h6l id 347.9 name 8H6L_anchor
# Rename 8H6L_anchor chains to systematic project IDs.
# Temporary safe-harbor IDs avoid collisions with deposited or target chain IDs.
changechains #347.9 2A,2B,2C,2D,2E,2F,2G,2H,2I,2J,2K,2L,2M,2a,2b,2c,2d,2e,2f,2g,4A,4B,4C,4D,4E,4F,4G,4H,4I,4J,4Z,4a,4b,4c,4d,4e,4f,4g,5A,5B,5C,5D,5E,5a,5b,5c,5d,5e,5f,5g,6A,6a,6b,6c,6d,6e,6f,6g,A TMP001,TMP002,TMP003,TMP004,TMP005,TMP006,TMP007,TMP008,TMP009,TMP010,TMP011,TMP012,TMP013,TMP014,TMP015,TMP016,TMP017,TMP018,TMP019,TMP020,TMP021,TMP022,TMP023,TMP024,TMP025,TMP026,TMP027,TMP028,TMP029,TMP030,TMP031,TMP032,TMP033,TMP034,TMP035,TMP036,TMP037,TMP038,TMP039,TMP040,TMP041,TMP042,TMP043,TMP044,TMP045,TMP046,TMP047,TMP048,TMP049,TMP050,TMP051,TMP052,TMP053,TMP054,TMP055,TMP056,TMP057,TMP058,TMP059 log false
